5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit worried about the person who has to count all the money. It seems like a lot of work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Minato, the workload is secondary. We need accurate revenue projections first. Guessing fees again is unacceptable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Ryuji. We need hard data, not guesses. Minato, your concern is valid, but accuracy comes first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"You’re all so serious. I just want people to actually show up without agonizing over it. Let’s find the data, but keep it fun.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Fun? Please. We’re setting prices, not planning a party. Let’s look at the actual numbers before we start guessing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think we should check the treasurer’s hours. It might show how much time the job really takes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll examine the bank statements on last year’s renewals. I need to verify actual cash inflows against our projections.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’ll review the sign-up records for mid-year joiners. I need to understand how many people are actually drifting in and finding their feet.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I’m checking the sign-in sheets and the rota against attendance. I need to see who’s actually there versus who’s just saying they’ll be.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record. I need to see who’s actually carrying the load versus who’s just paying the same fee.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I’m also looking at the ledger of outgoings. I want to see where the money goes, so we can be fair to the next person.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll also review last year’s ledger of outgoings. I need to reconcile actual spending against the budget to ensure our fee structure covers real costs.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I’ll also review the taster evening forms from non-joiners. I need to see why people hesitate to commit, as that visibility affects how newcomers drift in.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"I’m also checking the taster evening forms from non-joiners. I want to see why people hesitate to commit, as that visibility affects how newcomers drift in.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll also check the tally of the sign-in sheets. I need to quantify exactly how uneven the attendance is before we debate fairness.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the numbers are kind. I just want to make sure the next person isn’t overwhelmed by all the counting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I’ll close by stating our goal: a fee structure grounded in verified data, not speculation. Let’s proceed to the findings.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I’ll close by noting that visibility matters. If the structure feels opaque, newcomers won’t drift in. Let’s see what the data reveals about that balance.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I’m closing by saying the data will show us why people hesitate. Let’s make sure the fee doesn’t add to that hesitation.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll close by saying the data will expose who’s actually doing the work. Let’s stop pretending everyone contributes equally.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
